    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ɛ̈m-non kɛnɛ Ta-mar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ te Ɛ̈b-ca-lom gat Dee-bid kɛ nyiman mi gɔaa ɛlɔ̱ŋ, mi cɔal i̱ Ta-mar. Kɛ kɔr gua̱th mi tɔt cu Ɛ̈m-non gat Dee-bid mi te man gölä, jɛ nhɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈m-non ɛ nhɔk ɛlɔ̱ŋ a bɛ rɔ lɛl ciɛ tëë kɛ juey kɛ kui̱ nyiman ni Ta-mar. Kɛ ɣöö ɛ nya mi /ken met tɔ̱ɔ̱c kɛ wut, kä ce̱tdɛ kɛ mi thilɛ mi dëë Ɛ̈m-non ɛ lät kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä Ɛ̈m-non tekɛ määthdɛ mi cɔali Yo-na-dab gat Cimaa däman Dee-bid. Kä Yo-na-dab pɛlɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ɛ̈m-non jiök i̱, “Ma̱th gat kua̱r ɛŋu la gaki mɔ ni ciaŋ? Ɛŋu ciɛ lärä mɔ?” Kä cu Ɛ̈m-non ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɣän nhɔakä Ta-mar, nyiman dämaar ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-na-dab ɛ jiök i̱, “Pɛl rɔ ce̱t ti juey rɛy köliku. Mi wä guur ji̱ ben gui̱l, jiök ni jɛ i̱, ‘Ɛ nyimaar ni Ta-mar ɣä ben moc kɛ mi̱eth mi bä cam, a jɛ bëë ben la̱t a guɛcä, dɔ̱ŋ dëë jɛ cam tetädɛ.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈m-non tɔ̱ɔ̱c, pɛɛlɛ rɔ te juey. Kä min ci kuäär ɛ ben gui̱l cuɛ kuäär jiök i̱, “Ɛ nyimaar ni Ta-mar Ɣä ben lät kä mi̱eth a guɛcä, dɔ̱ŋ dëë jɛ cam tetädɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid raan jäk kä Ta-mar cieŋ wee i̱, “Wër dhɔr dämuɔɔr ni Ɛ̈m-non, bi jɛ wä lät kä mi̱eth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ta-mar wä dhɔr däman ni Ɛ̈m-non, kä tëë tɔ̱ɔ̱cä. Cuɛ nup ka̱n kä cuɛ läny, kä cuɛ mi̱eth la̱t a guicɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ la̱th rɛy tokä a guicɛ, duundɛ ɣöö cu Ɛ̈m-non mi̱eth lo̱k. Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “A nɛy diaal jiɛɛn kutdä.” Kä cu nɛy diaal jiɛɛn kutdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ta-mar jiök i̱, “No̱o̱ŋni mi̱eth duëël, dëë ben cam tetädu.” Kä cu Ta-mar mi̱eth in cɛ la̱t naŋ duëël kä Ɛ̈m-non däman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ nöŋ jɛ thiekä kɛ ɣöö derɛ mi̱th, cuɛ jɛ käp kä jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Bër tɔ̱a̱cnɛ nyimaar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ɛ̈m-non loc i̱, “/Ciɛ jɛn dämaar, /cu ɣä käp kɛ buɔ̱m. Kɛ ɣöö mi ce̱tkɛ nɔmɔ /kenɛ kɔn tuɔ̱k kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Cu mi jiääk lät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän dëë pöcdä ku lɛ lɛ̱̈ny nikä? Cu ji̱n bi cua̱ ram mi dɔ̱a̱r kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ täämɛ, kua̱ läŋ ni ji̱, ruacni kɛ kuäär. Dɔ̱ŋ /cɛ ɣä bi ka̱n kä ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö bum ni Ɛ̈m-non kä jɛ, cuɛ jɛ ka̱n kɛ buɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈m-non ɛ lo̱k nikɛ lo̱k mi di̱i̱t. Kä lo̱k in cɛ lo̱k ni jɛ cu di̱t ni jɛn kä nhök ëë cɛ nhɔk ni jɛ, kä cu Ɛ̈m-non jɛ jiök i̱, “Jiɛc rɔ, wërɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ɛ̈m-non loc i̱, “/Ciɛ jɛn, dämaar. Ɛn tukdu kɛ ɣä raar ɛ jɛn bia̱ duer in di̱t ni jɛn kä mi payi lät kä ɣä mi.” Kä duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ jɛ liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈m-non ŋuɛ̈tni tin la̱t jɛ ikä cɔl wee i̱, “Yuɔrɛ jɛ raar kutdä, kä lëkɛ thi̱i̱k kɔɔrɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn ciɛŋɛ bi̱i̱ mi bäär mi tekɛ biɛɛl. Ɛ jɛn min la nyiee kua̱r tin /ka̱n kuɛn kɛ a ciɛŋ. Kä cu ja̱a̱ŋkɛ jɛ yuɔr raar kä cua thi̱i̱k lëk thi̱n kɔɔrɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wi̱cdɛ moc ŋɛ̈th, kä cuɛ bi̱i̱ in bäär in ciɛŋɛ rɛ̈t. Kä cuɛ tetkɛ la̱th wi̱i̱dɛ, cuɛ wä kɛ wiee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu däman ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ɛ thiec i̱, “Aku dämuɔɔr ni Ɛ̈m-non te kɛɛl kɛ ji̱? Kap ni waŋdu nhial nyimaar. Jɛn ɛ dämuɔɔr. /Cu jɛ käp ala mi di̱i̱t.” Inɔ cu Ta-mar a ciek mi cieŋ kä rɔa dhɔr däman ni Ɛ̈b-ca-lom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kuäär ni Dee-bid ɛ liŋ cuɛ gaak ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thil mi cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ɛ la̱r Ɛ̈m-non, lökɛ Ɛ̈m-non. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ nyiman ni Ta-mar ka̱n kɛ buɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Näk Ɛ̈b-ca-lom kɛ Ɛ̈m-non",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr runi da̱ŋ rɛw cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom detkɛ miemkiɛn ŋuɔ̱k kä Baal-ɣa-dhor, min thieek kɛ Ɛ-pa-rim, kä cuɛ gaat kua̱r diaal cɔal ɛn wi̱ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ben kä kuäär jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Nɛnɛ, ja̱ŋdu ŋuɔ̱kɛ miem deetkɛ. Ɛŋu /canɛ wä, kɛɛl ɔ yɛnɛ ji̱ kɔaru?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäärɛ loc i̱, “Ëëy, gatdä, a kɔ /ca̱kɛ wä kɔn diaal, bi nɛy lɛ wa̱a̱ riɛk kä ji̱.” Cuɛ gua̱n läŋ, duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ wä cuɛ poth ni gatdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom wee i̱, “Kä mi /ci wä, ɛ dämaar ni Ɛ̈m-non wä kɛɛl kɛ kɔ.” Kä cu kuäär ɛ loc i̱, “Ɛŋu bɛ wä kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ɛ läŋ mäni min cɛ Ɛ̈m-non kɛnɛ gaat kua̱r diaal nhök wä. Kɛɛl kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ja̱a̱ŋkɛ la̱t lat i̱, “Ŋa̱cɛ jɛ mi wä Ɛ̈m-non wä Yɔ̱ŋ kɛ kɔaŋ, kɛnɛ mi wa̱a̱ yɛ jiök i̱, ‘Na̱kɛ jɛ,’ /cuarɛ dual. Na̱kɛ jɛ ɛ ɣän laarɛ mɔ. Buɔ̱mɛ rɔ kä /cuarɛ gal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ja̱a̱ŋ Ɛ̈b-ca-lom ɛ lät kä Ɛ̈m-non ce̱tnikɛ min ca la̱r kɛ ɛ Ɛ̈b-ca-lom. Kä cu gaat kua̱r diaal rɔ jiɛc, cu ramɔ muulɛ kɔt barɛ rɔ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min tekɛ dup, cu thok cop kä Dee-bid i̱, “Ci Ɛ̈b-ca-lom gaatku diaal näk, a thilɛ ram mi ci duɔth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär rɔ jiɛc, cuɛ bi̱i̱dɛ rɛ̈t, kä cuɛ rɔ yuɔr piny. Kä cu ji̱ kɔarɛ tin te gekädɛ bieynikiɛn rɛ̈t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu Yo-na-dab gat Cimi däman Dee-bid wee i̱, “Kuäär /ka̱n kɛ näk kɛn diaal kɛn gaatku. Ci li̱w ni Ɛ̈m-non kä rɔa. Kä nɛmɛ tuɔɔkɛ kɛ ruac Ɛ̈b-ca-lom nikɛ gua̱a̱th ëë käp Ɛ̈m-non nyiman ni Ta-mar kɛ buɔ̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ täämɛ kuäär cu jɛ cari ca gaatku diaal näk. Ci li̱w ni Ɛ̈m-non kä rɔa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö ci Ɛ̈b-ca-lom rɔ bar. Kä cu ram in gui̱c waŋdɛ kap nhial gui̱cɛ, cuɛ nɛy ti ŋuan nɛn bäkɛ dup in te jɔkdɛ gekä pa̱a̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yo-na-dab kuäär jiök i̱, “Nɛnɛ, ci gaatku ben. Ce̱tnikɛ min cä la̱r ji̱, kɛn ci ben ti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä niɛ min thukɛ kɛ ruac, cu gaat kua̱r cop, kä cukɛ wiee. Kä cu kuäär kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔarɛ wiee bä ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö ci Ɛ̈b-ca-lom rɔ bar, cuɛ wä kä Tɛ̈l-may gat A-mi-ɣud kuäär Gɛ-cur, kä cu Dee-bid gatdɛ par kɛ ni̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ɛ̈b-ca-lom rɔ bar kä Gɛ-cur, cuɛ te thi̱n kɛ run diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu lɔc",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13:39",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lɔc.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɛ thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru ëë wal. Kä thok Ɣi-bɛ-ru ɛ thia̱kɛ /cɛ jɔc agɔaa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kua̱r Ɛ̈b-ca-lom lɛ go̱r. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ ŋa̱c i̱ ci Ɛ̈m-non li̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.13.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
